{
  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">about</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>about<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"section about-hero\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">about Kiln</span><span class=\"meta\">Built by Porto Labs.</span></div><h1 id=\"about-title\">Independent<span>minds.</span></h1><div class=\"about-hero-bottom\"><p>We’re building Kiln for studios that want to shape their tools as carefully as their work.</p><img class=\"about-mark\" src=\"/assets/kiln-crucible-ink.svg\" alt=\"Kiln Crucible symbol\" width=\"80\" height=\"88\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"section principles\" id=\"principles\" aria-labelledby=\"principles-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / why we’re building Kiln</span><span class=\"meta\">A tool shaped by its purpose.</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"principles-title\">Making is<br>the point.</h2><p>A kiln turns raw material into something lasting. Our purpose is to help studios turn ideas into work they’re proud to put their name on.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / ownership</span><h3>A studio’s work<br>is its own.</h3><p>Studios should control the tools they use and the projects entrusted to them.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / creative judgement</span><h3>People set<br>the direction.</h3><p>AI should help a team explore its point of view. The choices and the final say belong to people.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / useful progress</span><h3>Measure<br>what matters.</h3><p>Pilots will test the quality of finished work, time saved and compute used.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"section team\" id=\"team\" aria-labelledby=\"team-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / the people behind it</span><span class=\"meta\">Product. Culture. Engineering.</span></div><div class=\"team-layout\"><h2 id=\"team-title\">Three founders.<br>One purpose.</h2><div><article class=\"founder\"><h3>Theo Bliss</h3><p class=\"meta\">Co-founder & Chief Product Officer</p><p>Product and creative direction. Experience at Google and Meta.</p></article><article class=\"founder\"><h3>Peter Xan</h3><p class=\"meta\">Co-founder & Chief Marketing Officer</p><p>Brand and marketing. Experience at TBWA / Media Arts Lab, BBH and M&C Saatchi.</p></article><article class=\"founder\"><h3>Richard Melkonian</h3><p class=\"meta\">Co-founder & Chief Executive Officer</p><p>Company and engineering. Engineer and filmmaker; experience at Movement Labs and Polymarket.</p></article></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section pilot\" id=\"interest\" aria-labelledby=\"interest-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / stay close to Kiln</span></div><h2 class=\"pilot-title\" id=\"interest-title\">Be first<span>to know.</span></h2><div class=\"pilot-bottom\"><p class=\"lead\">Hardware. KilnOS. Launch news.<br>Straight to your inbox.</p><div><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"fine\">No payment or commitment. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy details</a></p></div></div></section>\n</main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">about Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">the hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln updates.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Unsubscribe anytime. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">keep me posted <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Thanks for following along.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\" aria-describedby=\"contact-intro\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Let’s talk.</h2><p class=\"contact-intro\" id=\"contact-intro\">What are you working on?</p><form class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><input id=\"enquiry-interest\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"reason\" value=\"General question\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">your email</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"A project, a question, an idea…\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary contact-send\" type=\"submit\"><span data-submit-label>send message</span><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Message received.</h3><p>The Kiln team will follow up by email.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">hardware / compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>From £19,900</strong><p class=\"fine\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>Two-GPU configuration</dt><dd>£31,900 ex VAT</dd><dt>Upgrade when ordering</dt><dd>+£12,000 for a second GPU</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show hardware concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n",
  "title": "About Kiln — Independent minds.",
